      "description": "Skill names the analyzer filled and the router kept, against those a filter discarded (`mcp_domain`: filled against an MCP primary domain — measured 2026-09-20 on 3 of 4 tic-tac-toe turns, because the prompt forced a domain on a skill that touches none; the prompt now leaves it null. `unknown_skill`, `sentinel_name`: a name that is not a skill). A steady suppressed rate on one reason names a prompt to read."
